{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the most beautiful and photo realistic still life images you can image. Use your creative skills to get the thumbs up by other members of the community.\u00a0 Still Creator generates the most realistic images with physically based lighting through raytracing. What your scene improves over time. Use the simple navigation to add several objects and lights. Save and load your\u00a0 scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Still Creator you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Objects from a Library</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add 3D primitives like cubes, sphere, cylinders and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate 3D Objects from Text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Position, Rotation and Scaling of objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Materials and Colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different Metals as material</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add different Lights: Point, Spot, Distance, Sun and Ambient</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change color of lights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save scene to File</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load Scene from File</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export your scene as PNG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Gallery functions:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use denoiser for enhanced quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish your Scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rate your scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load scenes published by other players\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create scenes together interactively</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897460?t=1759930375","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps